#N canvas 50 50 1200 900 10;
#X text 20 5 Steel - pedal steel string (waveguide \, after Steelie by gur_shulman) \, bowed by breath: no pluck. Breath is the volume pedal and the bow \, and brightens the string. Knobs: Tone \, Sustain \, Steel \, Attack (how fast the breath swells in: 5 ms .. 2 s);
